{"seq":3,"slug":"bluetooth-pairing","title":"配对与连接管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-hardware-device-apis/wireless/bluetooth-pairing","wordCount":1678,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"配对与连接管理\">配对与连接管理</h1><p>用户合上笔记本盖子，去开了个会，回来打开——你的网页和那台心率带的连接早断了，所有特征对象成了废纸，但页面还傻乎乎地显示着会前最后一个读数。无线连接和有线最大的不同就在这里：它会因为关盖、没电、走出范围、被别的程序抢走而随时断开，而你的代码必须把这种「随时会断」当成常态来设计，而不是异常来兜底。这一篇专讲连接的下半生——监听断开、应对失效、以及如何在用户下次回来时静默重连。前两篇 <a href=\"web-bluetooth\">Web Bluetooth</a> 和 <a href=\"gatt-characteristics\">GATT 服务与特征</a> 教的是「连上并读写」，这一篇教的是「如何对待一条不可靠的链路」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>连接管理有两个核心概念。其一是<strong>权限与绑定的区别</strong>：网页不参与蓝牙 bonding，只管理「权限」（浏览器记住这个源可访问哪台设备）与「连接状态」，因此断开后所有 GATT 对象立即失效，重连必须从服务器重新逐层获取。其二是<strong>三种连接状态的变化路径</strong>——<code>gattserverdisconnected</code> 事件感知断线、<code>getDevices()</code> 免手势静默重连、指数退避控制重试节奏，以及用 <code>forget()</code> 主动撤销权限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"web-不是-bonding-权限不等于配对\">Web 不是 bonding：权限不等于配对</h2><p>先厘清一个常被混淆的概念。蓝牙协议层面有「绑定」（bonding）——设备间交换长期密钥、彼此记住、下次自动安全重连。但 Web Bluetooth 刻意不让网页参与 bonding：网页对它有权限的设备，被明确定义为「未绑定」。这有一个直接后果——浏览器不替你缓存 GATT 属性，断开后 <code>BluetoothRemoteGATTService</code>、<code>BluetoothRemoteGATTCharacteristic</code>、<code>BluetoothRemoteGATTDescriptor</code> 这些对象全部失效，重连时必须从 GATT 服务器重新一层层获取。</p>\n<p>所以这里的「配对」要打引号：网页层面没有真正的配对动作，只有「权限」——用户在选择器里选过一次，浏览器就记住「这个源可以访问这台设备」，仅此而已。理解这点能省掉一类困惑：你不需要、也无法在网页里管理蓝牙密钥，你只管理「权限」和「连接状态」两件事。权限的授予机制见 <a href=\"../foundations/permission-security-model\">权限与安全模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"监听断开-gattserverdisconnected\">监听断开：gattserverdisconnected</h2><p>无线连接断开时，浏览器在 <code>BluetoothDevice</code> 上派发 <code>gattserverdisconnected</code> 事件。监听它，是你感知断线、清理 UI、触发重连的唯一靠谱途径——别用轮询去猜连接还在不在。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function watchConnection(device) {&#10;  device.addEventListener(&#39;gattserverdisconnected&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    console.log(&#39;设备断开了&#39;);&#10;    markUIDisconnected(); // 立刻反映到界面，别再显示旧数据&#10;    // 此刻所有 service/characteristic 对象都已失效&#10;    scheduleReconnect(device); // 可选: 启动重连&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> watchConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  device.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gattserverdisconnected'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'设备断开了'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    markUIDisconnected</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 立刻反映到界面，别再显示旧数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 此刻所有 service/characteristic 对象都已失效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    scheduleReconnect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(device); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 可选: 启动重连</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键认知是：这个事件触发的瞬间，你之前缓存的所有 GATT 对象就都不能用了。任何「断开后还拿旧 characteristic 去 readValue」的代码都会抛错。正确姿势是在断开回调里立即把这些引用丢弃，UI 切到「已断开」状态，等重连成功再重新获取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一条连接的完整状态机\">一条连接的完整状态机</h2><p>把连接的一生画成状态机，能让你看清每个状态下该做什么、能做什么。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[未授权] --&gt;|requestDevice&lt;br/&gt;用户选中| B[已授权未连接]&#10;  B --&gt;|gatt.connect| C[已连接]&#10;  C --&gt;|getService/Char&lt;br/&gt;读写订阅| C&#10;  C --&gt;|关盖/没电/超范围| D[意外断开&lt;br/&gt;对象全失效]&#10;  D --&gt;|gatt.connect 重连| C&#10;  D --&gt;|放弃| B&#10;  B --&gt;|getDevices 静默拿回| B&#10;  B --&gt;|forget 撤销权限| A\">flowchart TD\n  A[未授权] --&gt;|requestDevice&lt;br/&gt;用户选中| B[已授权未连接]\n  B --&gt;|gatt.connect| C[已连接]\n  C --&gt;|getService/Char&lt;br/&gt;读写订阅| C\n  C --&gt;|关盖/没电/超范围| D[意外断开&lt;br/&gt;对象全失效]\n  D --&gt;|gatt.connect 重连| C\n  D --&gt;|放弃| B\n  B --&gt;|getDevices 静默拿回| B\n  B --&gt;|forget 撤销权限| A</pre><p>这张图里有三条值得记住的边。一是「已连接」自循环——只有这个状态能读写。二是「意外断开 → 重连」回到已连接，但重连后必须重走 getService/getCharacteristic。三是底部那条 <code>getDevices</code>——它让你在用户下次访问、还没点任何按钮时，就静默拿回之前授权过的设备句柄，这是免去重复弹选择器的关键，下一节细讲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"getdevices-免选择器的静默重连\">getDevices：免选择器的静默重连</h2><p>理想的产品体验是：用户第一次连设备时选一次，之后每次打开网页都自动重连，不再弹选择器。<code>navigator.bluetooth.getDevices()</code> 让这成为可能——它返回这个源之前授权过、浏览器仍记得的所有设备，无需用户手势。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"async function autoReconnect() {&#10;  const devices = await navigator.bluetooth.getDevices();&#10;  for (const device of devices) {&#10;    // 已有权限, 但设备此刻未必在范围内&#10;    device.addEventListener(&#39;gattserverdisconnected&#39;, () =&gt; onDrop(device));&#10;    try {&#10;      await device.gatt.connect(); // 不弹选择器, 直接连&#10;      await resubscribe(device); // 重连后必须重新获取并订阅&#10;    } catch {&#10;      // 设备不在范围, 等 advertisementreceived 或下次重试&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autoReconnect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> devices</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.bluetooth.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getDevices</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> devices) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 已有权限, 但设备此刻未必在范围内</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    device.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gattserverdisconnected'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onDrop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(device));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device.gatt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不弹选择器, 直接连</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resubscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(device); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 重连后必须重新获取并订阅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 设备不在范围, 等 advertisementreceived 或下次重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意两点。第一，<code>getDevices</code> 返回的是「有权限」的设备，不代表它此刻在范围内、能连上——<code>gatt.connect()</code> 仍可能失败，得容错。第二，连上后一切从头来：重新 <code>getPrimaryService</code>、<code>getCharacteristic</code>、<code>startNotifications</code>，因为旧对象早失效了。这套静默重连配合 <a href=\"../practice/progressive-enhancement\">渐进增强与降级</a> 里讲的特性检测，能让硬件功能「记住上次」，体验接近原生。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重连策略-退避与放弃\">重连策略：退避与放弃</h2><p>设备断开后立刻硬重连往往徒劳——它可能真的走远了。一套像样的重连策略需要指数退避加上限。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试的等待时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，常用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n = \\min(t_{max}, t_0 \\cdot 2^{n})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，即从基础间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 起每次翻倍、封顶在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。下表给一组实务参数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>1 秒</td>\n<td>首次重试前等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>倍率</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>每次失败后等待翻倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>30 秒</td>\n<td>避免间隔无限增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大重试次数</td>\n<td>5–10 次</td>\n<td>超过则放弃并提示用户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>立即重连触发</td>\n<td>用户主动操作时</td>\n<td>用户点了就别等退避</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>退避的意义是：设备临时抖动时快速恢复，真正离线时不无谓空转耗电。但记住给用户留一个「手动重连」按钮——当退避还在长间隔等待、而用户已经把设备拿回来时，他应该能立刻触发一次连接，而不必干等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用完要-forget\">用完要 forget</h2><p>权限是会一直挂着的——用户授权过一次，这个源就长期能 <code>getDevices</code> 拿回该设备，直到用户手动在浏览器设置里撤销。负责任的做法是，当用户在你的产品里主动「解绑」某设备，或确定不再需要时，调用 <code>device.forget()</code> 主动撤销这条权限。这既是隐私自律（别让授权无限期积累成设备指纹库），也是 <a href=\"../foundations/permission-security-model\">权限与安全模型</a> 里强调的开发者责任的一部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Web Bluetooth 不参与蓝牙 bonding：网页只管理「权限」和「连接状态」，无法也无需管理密钥。</li>\n<li>断开后所有 GATT 对象立即失效，重连必须从服务器重新逐层 <code>getService</code>/<code>getCharacteristic</code>，不能复用旧句柄。</li>\n<li>用 <code>gattserverdisconnected</code> 事件感知断线，别轮询；触发时立即清旧引用、切 UI 到已断开状态。</li>\n<li><code>getDevices()</code> 无需用户手势就能拿回已授权设备，是实现「记住上次、静默重连」的关键，但连接仍可能失败需容错。</li>\n<li>重连用指数退避加上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n = \\min(t_{max}, t_0 \\cdot 2^{n})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，并始终保留手动重连按钮；不再用的设备调 <code>forget</code> 撤权。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>如何首次连接与读写（本篇的前置）：<a href=\"web-bluetooth\">Web Bluetooth</a> 与 <a href=\"gatt-characteristics\">GATT 服务与特征</a></li>\n<li>权限授予机制与 forget 的隐私意义：<a href=\"../foundations/permission-security-model\">权限与安全模型</a></li>\n<li>静默重连如何配合特性检测：<a href=\"../practice/progressive-enhancement\">渐进增强与降级</a></li>\n<li>跨库：连接状态持久化与离线 UX 见 <a href=\"../../pwa-offline-first/offline-data/offline-state-ux\">35 PWA 离线优先 · 离线状态</a></li>\n<li>跨库：WebRTC 连接的断线重连模型作对照见 <a href=\"../../frontend-webrtc-media/foundations/signaling-ice\">50 前端 WebRTC 与媒体 · 信令与 ICE</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"配对与连接管理","id":"配对与连接管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Web 不是 bonding：权限不等于配对","id":"web-不是-bonding-权限不等于配对"},{"level":2,"text":"监听断开：gattserverdisconnected","id":"监听断开-gattserverdisconnected"},{"level":2,"text":"一条连接的完整状态机","id":"一条连接的完整状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"getDevices：免选择器的静默重连","id":"getdevices-免选择器的静默重连"},{"level":2,"text":"重连策略：退避与放弃","id":"重连策略-退避与放弃"},{"level":2,"text":"用完要 forget","id":"用完要-forget"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"GATT 服务与特征","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-hardware-device-apis/wireless/gatt-characteristics"},"next":{"title":"WebUSB 直操 USB 设备","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-hardware-device-apis/wired/web-usb"}}